## Model Scaffolding

Generate complete CRUD scaffolding from config:

```bash
gux model add              # Interactive model builder
gux model add --from-config # Generate from gux.config.json
gux model regen Client     # Regenerate after config changes
```

Define models in `gux.config.json`:

```json
{
  "models": {
    "Client": {
      "sections": {
        "Contact": [
          { "name": "FirstName", "type": "string", "required": true, "table": true },
          { "name": "Email", "type": "string", "input": "email" }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Generated files: `models/*_gen.go`, `dto/*_gen.go`, `admin/*_gen.go`

## Development Notes

- **Always use `gux dev`** (not `go run`) - it builds WASM and CSS
- Use `r.OnLoad()` for data fetching (supports SSR hydration)
- DTOs hide sensitive fields from API responses
- Mark cross-bundle links as `External: true`

## Generated Files (Do Not Edit)

- `guxgen/` - API client and WASM entry points
- `assets_gen.go` - Embedded assets

Run `gux gen` to regenerate after changing models or routes.
